# Slot-value exclusion for the {word} slot of Spell.intent (OVOS-INTENT-2 §4.3:
# a .blacklist paired by base name with a slot lists values that MUST NOT fill
# it, leaving the slot unresolved rather than binding them).
#
# Danish pronoun set, mirrors locale/en-US/word.blacklist. One phrase per line.
det
dette
disse
han
hun
de
ham
hende
dem
hans
hendes
deres
jeg
mig
min
mit
mine
du
dig
din
dit
dine
vi
os
vores